T1  - A systematic review of research on sitting and working furniture ergonomic from 2012 to 2022: Analysis of assessment approaches
AU  - Bai, Yifan
AU  - Kamarudin, Khairul Manami
AU  - Alli, Hassan
JO  - Heliyon
